# Every text file in your mission control is saved with the same line endings on every computer.
#
# Why: Windows and Mac or Linux end a line differently. When the same folder lives on two
# computers, an ordinary edit on one of them can come back as a change to every line of the file,
# and Git then shows a change nobody can read. This one line stops that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything that is not text keeps its bytes exactly.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.age binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ico binary
